{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 14, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler a Japanine quest\nA journey grand to put thy soul to test.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Bright Embrace**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt alight\nAt Narita's gate a wondrous sight.\nTo Shinjuku's heights thy carriage steer\nWhere neon glow doth banish fear.\nA hotel awaits a peaceful keep\nTo lull thy weary soul to sleep.\n\n**Day Two: Imperial Grandeur and Sacred Shrine**\n\nThe Imperial Palace a sight to behold\nWhere ancient stories bravely unfold.\nThen Meiji Jingu a temple serene\nWhere nature's grace is ever seen.\nHarajuku's streets a vibrant throng\nWith fashion bold and music strong.\n\n**Day Three: Asakusa's Charm and Sumida's Flow**\n\nTo Asakusa's heart thy steps shall lead\nWhere Senso-ji's incense doth proceed.\nAlong the Sumida River glide\nWith Tokyo Skytree open wide.\nA Sumida cruise a peaceful dream\nReflecting skies a silver gleam.\n\n**Day Four: Hakone's Beauty Mountains High**\n\nHakone's slopes a scenic grace\nWith Mount Fuji's form in time and space.\nA cruise on Lake Ashi a tranquil plea\nSurrounded by verdant majesty.\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm\nTo ease thy body keep it calm.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Ancient Heart Revealed**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto's door\nWhere history whispers evermore.\nFushimi Inari's gates a fiery hue\nA thousand torii for me and you.\nGion's district a geisha's dance\nA fleeting glimpse a sweet romance.\n\n**Day Six: Golden Pavilion and Zen's Stillness**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gleam a golden prize\nReflecting beauty to the skies.\nRyoan-ji's garden a mystic art\nWhere stones and sand play a silent part.\nArashiyama's bamboo grove so tall\nA whispered secret enchanting all.\n\n**Day Seven: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara town a journey brief\nWhere friendly deer bring sweet relief.\nTodai-ji Temple a wondrous show\nWith Buddha's statue standing low.\nKasuga Taish